《......》

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/ma05/021vs0300a00'>
//「……光も……まさか。
//　俺と同じ事を……」
"No... Did Hikaru... make the same mistake?"

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/ma05/021vs0310a00'>
//「山賊を殺して……
//　殺した数だけ、町の人々をも……？」
"She killed the bandits... then was forced to kill one person for each she'd slain?"

pt:
//【景明】
