  Yes, Mother's death was my fault. I have no intention of evading that responsibility. A tsurugi is but a weapon, a tool, as Hikaru said. The sin belongs to the man who wields it.

//　この劒冑は災いのものと、百も承知の上で、使って
//しまった湊斗景明の他に憎むべき相手はいない。
